{
  "_readme": [
    "AGMC & GB PANT HOSPITAL, AGARTALA — department entries.",
    "",
    "Rename to doctors.json to use. VERIFY EVERYTHING BELOW BY PHONE FIRST.",
    "",
    "WHY DEPARTMENTS AND NOT INDIVIDUAL DOCTORS",
    "AGMC publishes its department list and a main switchboard, but not",
    "individual doctors paired with contact numbers — and that is not an",
    "oversight. At a government medical college you do not ring a named",
    "consultant; you attend the department during OPD hours. Departments are",
    "also stable, whereas which doctor sits in OPD changes week to week, so a",
    "list of names would be wrong within a month.",
    "",
    "The 'name' field therefore holds the department, which is what the patient",
    "actually needs to ask for at reception.",
    "",
    "VERIFIED from official sources (August 2026):",
    "  - Address: Kunjaban, Agartala 799006, West Tripura   [agmc.ac.in/contact-us]",
    "  - Switchboard: 0381 2357130 / 0381 2356701           [agmc.ac.in/contact-us]",
    "  - Department list                                     [agmc.ac.in/department_overview]",
    "  - OPD registration 8am-3pm                            [health.tripura.gov.in]",
    "",
    "ASSUMED and needing confirmation — marked 'CHECK' in each entry:",
    "  - OPD runs Mon-Sat and is closed Sunday. Standard for government",
    "    hospitals in India, but confirm it for each department.",
    "  - Casualty and Trauma are open 24 hours. Near-certain for a medical",
    "    college casualty, but confirm.",
    "  - Registration closing at 3pm is treated as the department closing. In",
    "    practice consultation often continues past it. Confirm per department.",
    "",
    "DELIBERATELY NOT INCLUDED",
    "  Search results surfaced personal mobile numbers for the Principal and the",
    "  admissions authority. Those are published for administration and",
    "  admissions, not for patients. Sending someone mid-emergency to a",
    "  Principal's personal mobile would be both useless to them and a misuse of",
    "  the number. Only the institutional switchboard is used here.",
    "",
    "STILL MISSING — three specialities the app can recommend have nobody here:",
    "  cardiology, gastroenterology, orthopaedics.",
    "  AGMC's published department page does not list them (other sources",
    "  mention a Cardiology super-speciality unit — confirm with the hospital).",
    "  Until they are filled, those triage results show 'no doctors listed'.",
    "  Fill them from GBP once confirmed, or add an Agartala private clinic.",
    "",
    "COORDINATES are null on purpose. The hospital is in Kunjaban, but I will",
    "not guess numbers that place a hospital on a map. Right-click AGMC & GBP",
    "Hospital in Google Maps, copy the pair, and paste into every entry — they",
    "all share one campus, so the same lat/lng goes in each."
  ],

